00:16:34.087 --> 00:16:39.814
To really understand a demand that one capital can find a visitor's papers to its own borders,

00:16:40.394 --> 00:16:45.074
you have to see that a European short-stay visa is a shared door, not a private key.

00:16:45.074 --> 00:16:50.934
What follows is this hosts own explanation of that mechanism, not a finding from today's

00:16:50.934 --> 00:16:51.354
articles.

00:16:51.914 --> 00:16:56.954
Most European Union countries, plus a few neighbors, dropped routine checks on the borders

00:16:56.954 --> 00:16:59.494
between them and kept checks on the outside edge.

00:16:59.994 --> 00:17:05.054
A short stay visa is usually issued by one state but written for the whole area, because

00:17:05.054 --> 00:17:09.774
the point of abolishing internal controls was that a visitor cleared once should not be

00:17:09.774 --> 00:17:11.374
stopped at every next frontier.

00:17:11.374 --> 00:17:16.554
The issuing country does the paperwork and is supposed to be the main destination, yet

00:17:16.554 --> 00:17:18.954
the document is not that country's private pass.

00:17:19.654 --> 00:17:24.194
Any state on the external border can still refuse entry if the traveler fails the common

00:17:24.194 --> 00:17:24.714
conditions.

00:17:25.294 --> 00:17:30.434
Purpose, funds, a return ticket, security flags, even with a visa in the passport.

00:17:31.054 --> 00:17:34.554
That is a refusal at the door, not a rewrite of the visa's map.

00:17:35.234 --> 00:17:40.214
Changing the map so that a visa issued in one capital works only there is a change to

00:17:40.214 --> 00:17:45.134
a shared instrument. It needs the states that issue the common visa to agree. Because

00:17:45.134 --> 00:17:50.674
a government that cannot print a Europe-wide visa by itself also cannot alone, unprint

00:17:50.674 --> 00:17:55.474
the Europe-wide visas other capitals have already issued. Next time a government says

00:17:55.474 --> 00:18:00.194
it will confine that visa to one country, check whether the text is an instruction to

00:18:00.194 --> 00:18:04.274
its own consulates or a proposal the other issuing states still have to adopt.

00:18:04.274 --> 00:18:10.761
On the expulsion, the BBC reports the firearms and knives in the car, the band gang link,

00:18:11.041 --> 00:18:15.281
and the foreign ministers request that Russian short-stay visas count only in the issuing

00:18:15.281 --> 00:18:15.761
country.

00:18:16.201 --> 00:18:21.561
While France 24 adds Vonder Leyen's line that this was an attack on European Union soil,

00:18:22.221 --> 00:18:26.141
and reports that tighter limits on visas for Russian tourists have been announced.

00:18:26.721 --> 00:18:27.721
